menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_IMAGE_PRIVACY
    bool "Enable local image processing and upload authorisation"
    default n
    help
        Runs the bounded image-privacy policy and processing pipeline gate:
        opt-in local processing, guardian-gated upload, a processing mode, an
        upload scope, a retention window, a redaction level and a consent gate.
        A firmware profile without a camera simply does not link the component.

endmenu
